# The installer is experimental and only grants its narrowly scoped action to
# the locked live-session account. The policy pins pkexec to the exact service
# path; it is not submitted for inclusion in a SUSE product. A future product
# submission still requires the upstream SUSE security review.
# These security checks are deliberately non-filterable in rpmlint 2.7.
# Lower their package-local badness instead; the policy and rule remain in the
# report for audit visibility, while the experimental home project can build.
setBadness("polkit-untracked-privilege", 0)
setBadness("polkit-file-unauthorized", 0)
